# Kyverno CLI pin for scripts/check-kyverno-policy-tests.sh.
#
# The CLI must match the engine the cluster runs: the chart's appVersion. The
# chart (kustomization.yaml helmCharts[].version, mirrored per charts.lock.yaml)
# is the only version pinned in this repo, and it does not carry appVersion, so
# the pair is recorded here and the runner refuses to test with a CLI whose
# chart pairing is stale. When Renovate bumps the chart, bump BOTH lines: the
# appVersion is `helm show chart oci://registry.homelab.internal/homelab/kyverno
# --version <chart>` -> appVersion, or the chart's Chart.yaml upstream.
KYVERNO_CHART_VERSION=3.9.1
KYVERNO_CLI_VERSION=v1.19.1
